<title>UK: Paris canvasses banks on Credit Lyonnais sale - FT.</title>
<headline>Paris canvasses banks on Credit Lyonnais sale - FT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French finance ministry has approached some European banks and financial institutions to discover whether there are terms on which it could sell Credit Lyonnais, the troubled state-owned bank, the Financial Times reported.</p>
<p>Goldman Sachs, the U.S. investment bank advising the French government on Credit Lyonnais, has contacted bid banks, including Barclays Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
